    "Name": "Schiltron B",
    "Details": "A stand-off configuration, the Schiltron B carries four LRM-15s that are slaved to an Artemis IV Fire Control System. Half of these are mounted in the turret, the other pair in the front. Eight tons of ammunition is sufficient for sustained firing. Four Medium Lasers mounted in the turret provide backup.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       250     40\n<b>Left</b>         180     40\n<b>Right</b>       180     40\n<b>Rear</b>        135     40\n<b>Turret</b>      210     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      955    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Tacticon TC7000</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
    "Icon": "Schiltron"
  },
